{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_06",
  "title": "緊追猛趕",
  "storyCode": "DH-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ed109bad60d4c23b3a478c0e1ac495bc95387562900c665f210737e1b250eb8a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "水月選手在放棄了阻攔伏兵後，來到將陳林兩位選手掩埋的武器店廢墟之上，停留了一會兒後便不知所蹤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "我們所有的攝影機和無人機都沒有找到他的位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而第一梯隊中，甜蜜夏日隊，已經最先抵達游泳檢查點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "第一梯隊的其他隊伍也陸續穿過了游泳檢查點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而我們最關心的鼠膽龍威隊中，埃內斯托小弟為了殿後已經被打倒，我們的工作人員判斷他已經失去戰鬥能力了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "陳林兩位女俠此時卻依然沒有動靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "難道真的萬事休矣了嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳，你不是吧，你不會倒在這種地方的對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "text": "星熊小姐對比賽很在意呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哪裡，她絕對是給陳押了大注，才在那念叨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "認識這麼久了，這種比賽的輸贏，誰在乎啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "輸了又不代表就怎麼了，贏了也不能證明什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "我倒是希望她輸了，這樣我才好嘲笑她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哎，艾雅法拉，來，我來給你試試這款面霜，我覺得一定適合你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "text": "好的，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，又一聲轟鳴，從停留在埃內斯托武器店的鏡頭螢幕中傳來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "等等，這難道是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "螢幕中，硝煙散去，而從硝煙中走出來的，正是推著自行車的陳和林雨霞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "來了來了，終於來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "陳女俠與林女俠又一次地站上了比賽的舞台！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "但是，兩人只剩下一輛車，位置距離游泳檢查點還有一小段距離，而此時第一梯隊已經開始了游泳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "鼠膽龍威真的還有機會嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你先走，我用跑的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "上車。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "別讓我再說一次，上車。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你確定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我來騎，你來解決礙事的傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "太令人感動了，雖然只剩下一輛車，但是林女俠並沒有拋棄陳女俠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "她讓陳女俠站上自己的車後座，由她來騎車，而陳女俠負責對付那些想要妨礙她們的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "兩個人，一輛自行車，一次讓所有人都目瞪口呆的完美配合！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "現在我敢說，她們兩個的組合，是這場大獎賽中最強大的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你壓到我頭髮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "敵人在前面，我也沒辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你能不能不要亂扭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "要不然你來騎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陳忽地壓下林雨霞的頭，躲開了迎面而來的一個輪胎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林雨霞卻猛地抬頭，狠狠撞在陳的臉上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "林雨霞，你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "意外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "鼠膽龍威隊，飛快地突破了最後一段跑道，進入了沙灘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "游泳檢查點就在她們的眼前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "但是，其他隊伍顯然不會那麼輕易地讓她們通過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "一場沙灘上的惡戰，即將爆發！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
